      "id": "e_lab",
      "type": "arrival",
      "label": "Héctor-1 flees to lab with time machine",
      "description": "Fleeing across a fence, Héctor stumbles into a research facility where a lone scientist shoves him into an enormous tank - a time machine - to hide him from the attacker.",
